INT. HOSPITAL ROOM - DAY

DR. AMY CHEN, a tall woman in a white coat with a stethoscope, checks the chart. MR. HOLLIS (80s), a grumpy old man in pajamas, lies in bed.

MR. HOLLIS
I want my pudding.

DR. CHEN
(smiling)
After the tests, Mr. Hollis.

NURSE PAT, a cheerful young man in blue scrubs, enters with a tray. BENNY, a little boy, runs in behind him.

BENNY
Grandpa!

Benny jumps on the bed and hugs Mr. Hollis. Nurse Pat drops the tray. Everyone laughs.
